hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1473","On the authority of Muhammad ibn Rafi’, on the authority of Al-Fadl ibn Dukain, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Uthman ibn Hakim, whose origin was a civilian who lived in Kufa, on the authority of Abd Al-Rahman bin Abi Amra, on the authority of Uthman bin Affan, said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Whoever prays the evening prayer in a group, will It is like standing in prayer for half a night, and whoever prays Fajr in a group, it will be like standing in prayer all night.”"
